  "description": "Official Recurly API v3 schema v2021-02-25. Docs: https://recurly.com/developers/api/v2021-02-25/. One node; operations via `operation`. operation=trigger is kind:ingress — it does not open a socket. Use a BPMN message start / catch / boundary event; StudioQuack webhook ingress correlates onto those events. There is no Webhook node. HARD PCI: cardholder data never enters the graph. Use processor tokens (pm_, nonce, encryptedCard, vault id) only. Never PAN, CVC, track data, or raw bank account numbers on INPUT/OUTPUT/logs. API keys are StudioQuack password secrets. Bind api_key as Base64(api_key + ':'). Recurly.js tokens only — never PAN. EU host eu.recurly.com when applicable. subscription_cancel may send optional timeframe (bill_date | term_end).",
